    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Code & Test\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n\r\nTurn your flowchart into working code. Use nested `if/else` to match your two diamonds, and make each leaf cause a visible change. As you code, use AI to check your logic and debug.\r\n",
